/* The guild war boards' modern look (the reviewed WGuildWar board of stage
   1): a column of small panels 10dp from the left and 50dp from the
   bottom, the first war at the bottom and each later one above it, 4dp
   apart. A board holds the two guilds' rows, 4dp apart: each a sunken
   26dp cell with the guild's mark (16 x 12, framed) and its text, 30dp in.
   Its width follows its longest text, 160dp at least (legacy computes
   30 + longest name * 6 + 40). Classic (the thin board, 50dp tall, the
   marks at 10, 10 + 18k and the texts at 30, 10 + 18k, uiguild.py:396-428):
   skins/classic/windows/guild-war.rcss. */

body.guild-war
{
	focus: none;
	tab-index: none;
}
.guild-war__column
{
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	align-items: flex-start;
	gap: 4dp;
	position: absolute;
	left: 10dp;
	bottom: 50dp;
}
.guild-war__slot
{
	display: block;
}
.nui-panel.guild-war__board
{
	display: block;
	min-width: 160dp;
	padding: 9dp 10dp;
	font-size: var(--font-md);
	font-weight: bold;
	color: var(--text);
}
.guild-war__row-slot
{
	display: block;
	margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
}
.guild-war__row-slot:last-child
{
	margin-bottom: 0;
}
.guild-war__row
{
	display: block;
	position: relative;
	box-sizing: border-box;
	height: 26dp;
	padding-left: 30dp;
	padding-right: var(--space-2);
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--border);
	border-radius: 6dp;
	background-color: var(--surface-sunken);
	line-height: 24dp;
	white-space: nowrap;
}
/* The mark, framed by a dark hairline. */
.guild-war__mark
{
	position: absolute;
	left: 6dp;
	top: 5dp;
	width: 16dp;
	height: 12dp;
	border-width: 1dp;
	border-color: var(--overlay-scrim);
	border-radius: 2dp;
}
